    "detailed_description": "FukTopia 5 is a frantic post apocalyptic Top Down game.<br><br>Procedural Level Generation<br><br>Each level is orocedural with random elements so you will be faced with unique levels each time you play. <br><br>The fast-paced action is spiced up with a beautiful art found throughout the procedural level generation each time you play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165520/extras/b415ed03d2dd4b046120aea7d1a0dde2.poster.avif?t=1711257575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165520/extras/b415ed03d2dd4b046120aea7d1a0dde2.webm?t=1711257575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165520/extras/b415ed03d2dd4b046120aea7d1a0dde2.mp4?t=1711257575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Gameplay<br>The player enter into a procedural generated level and need to clear the entire level from enemies to go to the next level.<br><br><br><strong>Features and Content</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> One Character to choose and play<br></li><li> Levels with different themes and enemies<br></li><li>  All level are procedurally and ramdomly generated to add more randomness to each gameplay ( Every game is different - random levels ).<br></li><li>  Amazing Pixel Art</li></ul>",
